  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "If the Loop Is the Product, Observability Becomes the Operating System",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "but it is not a changelog. It is the next turn of the same argument",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "thing I actually confirmed today is not \"the passes run",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The model is not the product",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "a summary, a hypothesis, a slide. That moment is the least interesting part of the",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "system. What matters — and what is almost always missing — is the accumulated,",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "A large language model is a stateless function",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "line this whole project is built on — is not the model",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "So the design question is not \"which model",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "The compiler metaphor is literal",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "that IR through a series of passes, and emits an object file. The IR is the whole",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "point. It is the thing you inspect, diff, and debug",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Because every pass writes a typed, schema-validated IR, the loop is observable",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "When a hypothesis is wrong you do not interrogate a black box",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "That chain is the payoff",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "If the loop is the product, then observability becomes",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "A summarizer lists \"key findings.\" That is retrieval wearing a lab coat",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "no stated mechanism is rejected at the schema",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "missing edge is two mechanisms with no link; an \"unresolved mechanism\" is an",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "edge whose boundary conditions are empty or contested",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "contested, or **silent**. The silence map is the single highest-value output of",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "asserted everywhere but the direct phosphorylation targets are never actually",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "named. That gap is exactly what a human expert flags in the margin and what an LLM",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Causality is assessed over mechanisms, not surface claims",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Consensus is assessed",
      "confidence": null,
      "evidence_refs": []
    }
